    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cedc5390-4719-4206-96ff-2732337484ae-image14.png\" /><br />First refraction, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br />From lens formula, <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />First reflection, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br />From mirror formula, <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Second refraction, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br />From lens formula, <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Finally, image will be at distance <math><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> from lens and is of same size as object.",
